<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:05:06Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>美中各從「白宮習特會」得到什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T12:15:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad--0b8992f22340.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq2dwkw2j0r4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">外界關注的人工智能、稀土等迫切議題，兩國似乎未有明顯進展。但有學者向BBC中文分析，會談最重要的成就在於展示兩國關係「正面友好的氛圍和形象」。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平促特朗普「反對台獨」，北京措辭升級要的是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3eqkqq1pweo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T10:23:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3eqkqq1pweo/trad--e36bec527a91.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3eqkqq1pweo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析指出，北京此次的表述更為直接，並試圖掌握峰會後的敘事主導權，未來台灣在美中台三角關係中的角色可能進一步被「邊緣化」。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美：白宮國宴誰出席、誰缺席？意味了什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5zjzl8n2epxo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T06:00:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5zjzl8n2epxo/trad--2d5852d57d30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5zjzl8n2epxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">多名美國科技和金融界巨頭有份出席，部份人士更與兩國領導人同桌。但近日高調警告人工智能風險的企業Anthropic代表未有出席。</summary></entry><entry><title>數百艘中國漁船出現在越南外海，北京想要什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T07:22:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad--bbc4a6721c27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck1l6ynmmvlvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近年愈來愈多中國漁船在越南外海活動，部分更有執法和政府船隻伴隨。研究人員認為，這不只是捕魚，也涉及北京在南海的主權聲索和地緣政治盤算，而越南漁民的生計和作業空間正受到愈來愈大壓力。</summary></entry><entry><title>「讓女性感到被看見」：為何荷蘭人為陰唇創造了一個新詞？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2z782j7y7o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T00:03:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2z782j7y7o/trad--cf64f50a0fbf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2z782j7y7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">倡議人士希望，這些新詞語能減少對身體的羞辱，並推動更正向的性觀念。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美最後一天 參觀國家檔案館後返華</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c97700x5exleo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:05:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T17:48:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c97700x5exleo/trad--86dbe802ce4c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c97700x5exleo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在訪美行程的最後一天，中國國家主席習近平伉儷與美國總統特朗普（川普）伉儷在白宮茶敘，然後參觀國家檔案館，之後啟程回國。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平獲特朗普紅地氈迎接，但並非事事如願</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckvgyjmq84g4o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:54:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckvgyjmq84g4o/trad--5c0404d3f2a5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckvgyjmq84g4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國希望在貿易、科技和台灣議題上取得進展，但成果未如預期。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美首日看點：誰同行？第一夫人角色？高規格接待引反彈？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjzxze5peg76o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T08:06:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjzxze5peg76o/trad--5287dce8169f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjzxze5peg76o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文整理，習近平抵達華盛頓一刻，外界關注的重點看點：誰是習近平訪美團成員？美國共和黨及人民對中國的態度為何？</summary></entry><entry><title>中國希望伊朗戰爭結束，但不是以特朗普想要的方式</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp847n9n7m2o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T22:52:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp847n9n7m2o/trad--06f718665e29.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp847n9n7m2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析人士指，北京可能推動德黑蘭重啟談判，但不太可能停止購買伊朗石油。</summary></entry><entry><title>OpenAI智能體入侵澳洲政府網站竊取資料 官方兩月後才發覺</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39me0emplyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T06:35:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39me0emplyo/trad--b289b96f32d0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq39me0emplyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">OpenAI在事發後兩個月才察覺事件，並遲至本月中，才用一般電郵的方式通知澳洲政府。澳洲政府形容事件令人震驚，批評OpenAI的處理手法「不可接受」。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平開展訪美 貝森特宣佈兩國貿易戰繼續「停火」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgyl2k378go/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T03:13:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgyl2k378go/trad--ae47e43f3f53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvgyl2k378go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平專機抵達首都華盛頓附近的安德魯斯聯合基地，美國總統特朗普（川普）打破慣例，親自接機。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯佔領烏克蘭城市：居民靠野菜維生，死者遺體「棄置街頭」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zjzl7gl9ero/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T03:56:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zjzl7gl9ero/trad--8afcedb107c4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6zjzl7gl9ero/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC採訪了遭俄羅斯佔領的烏克蘭城鎮奧列什基居民，他們表示自己正「持續不斷遭受炮擊」。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普與習近平會面在即，中國的AI雄心正在烏蘭察布高歌猛進</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqjdvg991dmxo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T07:30:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqjdvg991dmxo/trad--709751b195df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqjdvg991dmxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC探訪內蒙古，一名工人表示，北京的AI基礎設施正以「中國速度」推進。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你有五年規劃，我有移民計劃」：香港年輕人為何焦慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T18:19:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad--de8c1aec18c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月16日，香港特首李家超發表香港首個五年規劃文件及年度施政報告。但在網絡上，部分年輕人卻開始討論如何離開香港。BBC中文訪問三位香港青年，了解他們的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>習特會前瞻：特朗普會再度爭取「釋放黎智英」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cry8zw43qn4po/trad#2</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T11:43:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cry8zw43qn4po/trad--df8aa054506b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cry8zw43qn4po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美兩國元首即將會面，有學者分析，特朗普將在會面期間提及黎智英案，中方釋放黎智英是展現中國軟實力的合適時機，但相信機率不大。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國、台灣民眾如何看「習特會」？專家如何解讀峰會成果？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:05:06Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:18:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad--18f15465e5e4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平時隔11年再次訪美進行國是訪問，與美國總統特朗普舉行今年第二次會晤。今次「習特會」有哪些成果？中國及台灣民眾又如何看待？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美AI競賽：世界變得更危險還是更安全？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T08:12:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad--d8f0d79e0ed7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwx2zmzd63gxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC與嘉賓將共同分析中美兩國在AI技術發展過程中面臨的挑戰、兩國在AI監管與發展等問題上的分歧。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美晤特朗普：中美競賽誰領先？美國民眾怎麼看</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T02:16:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad--fda815467f9f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckddvj0jy3zgo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「特習會2.0」即將登場，此時中美競爭白熱化、亦敵亦友，美國民眾認為誰正在領先？BBC中文走訪紐約街頭，聽聽他們最期待兩位元首討論哪些議題？美國大眾眼中的習近平與特朗普又是如何？</summary></entry><entry><title>草原上的數據中心：中國AI雄心背後的算力前線</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T13:24:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad--62ff8006dc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國內蒙古遼闊的草原上，數十座數據中心正以驚人速度拔地而起。曾經的農田與草原，正在快速轉變為支撐中國AI雄心的「引擎」，以滿足狂飆的算力需求。</summary></entry><entry><title>戴安娜弟弟出書談王室 查爾斯曾稱她「很快會被遺忘」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-21T10:03:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad--6798bb96b1fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c80462gvk1k0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">戴安娜王妃逝世近30年之際，她的弟弟史賓賽伯爵出版新書，重提姐姐去世後的王室事件。他聲稱，時任王儲查爾斯曾認為戴安娜很快會被世人遺忘，但這項說法遭到王室否認。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普為何親赴機場，超規格接待習近平？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgw6r62jr7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-24T10:20:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgw6r62jr7o/trad--b84b00ae21e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgw6r62jr7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這是習近平時隔11年再次國事訪問美國。更是相隔64年，再有美國總統親自迎接他國元首到訪。有學者向BBC中文分析特朗普的舉動，既是在與中方「做生意打交道」；也是在向美國民眾展示自己的能力。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平訪美晤特朗普：中美AI超級強國的雄心成為焦點</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9kgv31pg8eeo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T23:30:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9kgv31pg8eeo/trad--d74e807c3e3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9kgv31pg8eeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國與中國正爭奪人工智能領先地位，同時尋求確保這項技術仍在人類掌控之中。</summary></entry><entry><title>美中峰會前，蕭美琴訪歐背後的「利基」外交</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T00:17:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad--6c87153cbaa0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn4k00yrpgxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">但在這樣的空間中，仍浮現出一條外交路徑：交往對象既不是一個主權國家，而是一個國際組織（即歐盟）；同時也不是其行政分支，而是其立法分支（歐洲議會）。這一雙重錯位，可以找到一個不容易受到中國壓力的外交場域。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能踩「剎車」？特朗普：別忘了中美競爭</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T06:43:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad--abfd280f0f97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/clyrkq2ew44o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">上星期六，達里奧·阿摩迪（Dario Amodei）呼籲放緩發展步伐,以「降低出現嚴重問題的風險」，奧特曼和馬斯克均表示認同。這名Anthropic行政總裁同時強調，任何放緩都必須有所限度，以免讓中國反超領先。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍航母全數撤離印太：台灣該擔心「空窗期」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:35:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad--6657e14d6610.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c87v33gxr01o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">專家稱，航母給美國盟友的是心理保證。印太區域沒有航母，「會加強一種整體感覺：美國正被中東局勢分心。」</summary></entry><entry><title>「雙休購」爆紅與下架：一個網購平台如何撬動勞工權益討論</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T10:03:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad--b8c19d3c8d4b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr9dw3z7v01yo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">提倡雙休的民間自發平台「雙休購」曇花一現後快速被下架，中國打工人開始在社交媒體上要求雙休正當權利。學者指這樣的消費抵制是正向的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>日本以街道整潔無瑕而聞名，但為什麼公共垃圾桶卻如此難找？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T06:50:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad--88c7839168c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c69v9207z2vwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果你花一天時間在東京觀光，可能會發現自己一路拿著空咖啡杯、7-Eleven蛋三明治的包裝紙，以及愈來愈強烈的困惑感。日本以重視整潔聞名，那麼，為什麼卻找不到地方丟垃圾呢？</summary></entry><entry><title>專家評中國修《國防動員法》：吸俄烏教訓實現「平戰快速轉換」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad--216c74954be4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gr202jdzpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新法還首次明定，18至60歲男性、18至55歲女性原則上須擔負國防勤務；金融、交通、電信、能源、醫療、糧食等關鍵領域，在動員期間均可採取特別措施。</summary></entry><entry><title>星宇股份解約風波：107名應屆生「告洋狀」揭示中國勞工維權現狀</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-15T00:17:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad--8a55aafaa223.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c4gkqekn7q7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月9日，就近期在中國引起轟動的「星宇股份解約107位應屆生」事件，上交所向星宇股份下發監管工作函，港交所延緩其上市審核，此前，公司董事長周曉萍已公開道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄烏戰場為何或會迎來新一批朝鮮軍人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T11:25:51Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad--bb5c4cb43663.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr7dl0n178do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">朝鮮（北韓）士兵於2024年底被平壤派遣，與俄羅斯部隊並肩作戰，試圖擊退烏克蘭的一次攻勢。烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，俄羅斯沃羅涅日地區正進行準備，以接收新一批朝鮮部隊。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港提出「人民幣支付政府開支」為何引發「去美元化」憂慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T03:20:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad--ae05eae289a9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c65y501pjww4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有經濟學者對BBC中文指出，港府希望建立「示範作用」，未來甚至「可能連收稅都收人民幣」，增加其他國家在香港使用人民幣買賣黃金、投資股票的信心。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國強勢下，歐洲電池工業謀求「重新充電」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T00:19:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad--fa0b5dd070c0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cn8ex870p05o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲擁有一些前景可期的電池技術，但它能否追回被中國電池巨頭拉開的差距？</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平七年再訪印度：金磚峰會握手背後，中印關係破冰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T10:56:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad--f490ef71bcd9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cg7knkpjr39o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">金磚峰會《新德里宣言》呼籲對伊朗戰爭「最大克制」卻不點名美國。而習近平七年首訪印度，中印關係解凍了嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>香港支聯會「煽動顛覆」案：被告們的伴侶與戰友</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:23:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad--ca085d2d883b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq63868gq5qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港支聯會「煽顛」案歷經五年，三名核心人物的判刑結果塵埃落定。BBC中文訪問李卓人的妻子鄧燕娥及鄒幸彤戰友劉家儀，講述他們如何面對香港的變遷和怎樣陪伴在牆內的人。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#6</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>外星生命會讓我們生病嗎？太空微生物帶來哪些風險</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T00:29:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad--9bbfe3670ade.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq5xp9n7gv2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">數十年來，我們一直在尋找地球以外的生命。然而，如果我們發現的是微生物，就必須確保它們不會令我們染病。</summary></entry><entry><title>領英高層分享6個人脈竅門，幫你更快找到工作</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-17T09:48:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad--e3616c6e04f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63rezxeyw9qo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從咖啡閒聊到領英訊息，以下是如何透過人脈關係找到下一份工作的方法。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我接受了11年化療，卻發現從未患癌」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T00:18:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad--c278cc5b12f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm62eve2y6xeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">貝姬·瓊斯（Becky Jones）21歲被告知患有末期腦癌，接受了長達11年的化療，近期才發現根本不是癌症。和她有類似經歷的，還有同一間醫院的另外40多名病患。</summary></entry><entry><title>協助死亡：世界各地法律有何不同</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-14T08:19:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad--96fcfcf8ead4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0lr7lx49l8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球約有4億人可以獲得某種形式的協助死亡（安樂死）服務，這些國家的政策都是怎樣的？</summary></entry><entry><title>女性比男性更擅長耐力跑嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-09-25T20:04:03Z</updated><published>2026-09-13T02:47:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad--6fce54d2002f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c0m34g3v7zjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">近月來，女性在多項備受矚目的耐力賽事中擊敗男性對手。她們是否天生更適合這類挑戰？</summary></entry></feed>
